# Remotion's install tree. The two card compositions are source and belong in
# the repository; node_modules does not. On 2026-09-12 a `git add -A` in this
# session swept 9,104 of its files into a commit while the video session was
# installing, which is why this line exists rather than a reminder to be careful.
demo/remotion/node_modules/
